---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftDebtWorkPackage
---
Construct a DebtWorkPackage draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Convert supported mechanisms into finite improvement packages with explicit interfaces and non-goals. Propose alternatives with different disruption levels, avoid unbounded rewrites, and define completion through changed behavior rather than merged code alone.
